: 2, "region": "north_america"}}], "screenshots": [{"id": 86654, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/xmwyknk1uahn639jew4v.jpg"}, {"id": 86650, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/nexw1dobovdpnnxup1qb.jpg"}, {"id": 86651, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/yxccjbscxtfjdehkqldy.jpg"}, {"id": 86652, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/ouzabqkutl2d8w4ekutu.jpg"}, {"id": 86653, "url": "//images.igdb.com/igdb/image/upload/t_thumb/h9ouhfvzzxsxsda0k5og.jpg"}], "slug": "terminal-velocity", "storyline": "The story is set in the year 2704, when the ASFAR (Alliance of Space-Faring Alien Races), of which Earth is a member, suddenly turns against Earth and their fleet ravages the planet, starting a war. The player flies a powerful starfighter, the TV-202, in a series of missions to defeat the enemy. In Episode 3, the player learns that a huge supercomputer known as X.I. (Xenocidic Initiative), located on Proxima Seven, is responsible for the war. Their final mission is to eliminate it. A hidden mission can take place after the main plot only in the CD ROM version where the player must investigate a sudden metamorphosis of an unknown nearby planet and destroy the force that changed the face of the planet. It is revealed here that this force drove a man named Sy Wickens into insanity, and how the X.I. Supercomputer had \"accidentally\" digitized Sy Wickens' persona.", "summary": "Terminal Velocity is a simulation video game. It is an arcade-style flight combat game, with simpler game controls and physics than flight simulators. It is known for its fast, high-energy action sequences, compared to flight simulators of the time.", "themes": [{"id": 1, "name": "Action"}, {"id": 18, "name": "Science fiction"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/terminal-velocity", "videos": [{"id": 4979, "name": "Gameplay video", "video_id": "xsGYM1GErrY", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=xsGYM1GErrY", "title": "Terminal Velocity Gameplay (HD)", "thumb": "https://i.ytimg.com/vi/xsGYM1GErrY/maxresdefault.jpg"}]}